# Media & workspace extras — cross-device sync (imperative)

YouTube favourite channels, News tags / last-good headlines, and Markets watchlists **must sync across web, tablet, and mobile**. Never treat them as device-local.

## Required behavior

1. **fullArchive / workspaceExtras** — YouTube (`youtube` + `youtubeVideos`), News (`news` + `newsArticles` + `newsFilter`), Markets (`markets` + `marketQuotes`), and display FX (`fxRates`) stay in the encrypted sync envelope. Satellites import Mini’s last FX / quotes on Unlock; Mini does not let a stale satellite overwrite a newer live fetch.
2. **Mark dirty on real edits** — add/remove/reorder channel or tag, Mark all read, etc. call `markWorkspaceChangedForSync()` so a push runs (~4s) whenever the passphrase is unlocked. **Automatic sync can be off.** After unlock (`lastSyncAt`), a satellite extras / portfolio edit pull-then-pushes so a channel or holding added on MacBook / iPad reaches Mini. Never push a leftover satellite book before the first pull.
3. **Never mark dirty on first-load seed** — `loadYoutubeState` / `loadNewsState` / `loadMarketsState` empty seeds must use `{ silent: true }`. Unread badges call these on every open; a dirty empty seed can push over another device’s favourites. A satellite that has a Remote URL but no `lastSyncAt` must seed **blank** News tags / Markets tickers (not factory BTC/ETH/TSLA defaults) so Unlock lands Mini’s list instead of unioning leftovers.
4. **First extras apply replaces leftovers; later pulls union + tombstones** — a satellite with a Remote URL and no `lastWorkspaceExtrasSyncAt` takes Mini’s YouTube / News / Markets / last-good headlines as-is (drops the leftover 8 local channels). After extras stamp, merges union by id; removals use tombstones (`deletedChannels` / `deletedTags` / Markets `deletedTickers`) so deletes propagate and do not resurrect. A satellite with Mini’s URL must not run `mergeDefaultTickers` on load or import (Unlock’s `lastSyncAt` must not refill factory FX/index onto Mini’s watchlist).
5. **Conflicts must not block media** — when portfolio conflicts are parked, still call `applyWorkspaceExtrasFromPreview` so YouTube / News / Markets apply on web/tablet/mobile.
6. **All form factors** — same Sync Remote URL + passphrase + Automatic sync + Remember passphrase. No separate “tablet-only” or “PWA-only” media store.
7. **Unlock applies extras** — a satellite that shows Unlock sync (MacBook / iPad / phone) must be able to enter the Mini passphrase on Today / YouTube / News / Markets and immediately `unlockAndPullFromCloud` so favourite channels, tags, Markets, prices, FX, and the portfolio book land. That path **pulls only** — never push a leftover MacBook list over Mini. After extras land (Unlock **or** satellite auto-pull `doPull`), `refreshLiveMarksAfterUnlock` fetches live FX + Markets marks and fires `mydsp-unlock-live-marks` so holdings refresh (force, no throttle) and envelope quotes do not snap sizes back to Mini’s last PUT. Settings Sync and header Refresh on a satellite also call `unlockAndPullFromCloud`. Do not send the user to Settings-only. Show the banner whenever the satellite has a sync footprint and has not pulled (`lastSyncAt`) — a remembered passphrase or `lastWorkspaceExtrasSyncAt` alone is not enough. Automatic off is not an excuse.
8. **Backup on Mini is not device-local only** — `createFullBackup` (Backup now + daily) pushes the encrypted envelope when Mini is the book and the passphrase is unlocked. **Automatic sync can be off.** Satellites must not push from Backup. Mini `pushSync` (Backup, boot, Settings Sync) must `absorbRemoteWorkspaceExtrasBeforePush` first — union YouTube / News / Markets from the cloud so a satellite channel is never reverted.
9. **Satellite boot pull / Mini boot push** — on app start, a satellite with a remembered passphrase and Remote URL calls `unlockAndPullFromCloud` even when Automatic is off. Mini (book) with passphrase + URL `pushSync`s the extras envelope on the same boot timeout — Automatic can be off — so MacBook Unlock is not waiting on a Sync tap. That boot PUT still absorbs satellite extras first (never revert). While Mini stays open with Automatic off, focus / 60s / online absorb a satellite extras push and PUT only when extras arrived or Mini is dirty (no empty 60s upload). While a satellite stays open with Automatic off, focus / 60s / online still `doPull` (`maybePullSatelliteExtras`) so a Mini YouTube / News / Markets change lands without reload — pull only, then `refreshLiveMarksAfterUnlock`. Offline-queue flush and Advanced Push on a satellite also pull only. A satellite must not PUT into an empty cloud.
10. **Advanced Pull / Apply / file import on a satellite REPLACE** — Settings Advanced **Pull & merge**, **Apply merge**, `.enc.json` import, `pullAndMerge` / `importEncryptedFile`, and the conflict sheet must call `applyReviewedPull` (satellite → `applyRemoteAsBook`). Never skip REPLACE because `preview.conflicts.length > 0` — leftover DAVID always conflicts. Never `applyMergePreview` union leftover holdings on a MacBook / iPhone / iPad — that merge can later push over Mini. Mini (book) still reviews and unions. Settings media pull refreshes live marks after extras. **Rotate passphrase → Re-encrypt & push** is Mini-only; a satellite must not `pushSync` leftovers under a new passphrase. **Draft Worker previews** (`cursor-*-mydspv1…`, leftover `cursor-*-mydsp…`, and commit hosts like `047722a6-mydspv1…`) must not `pushSync` — they are a new origin with an empty book. Live and `main-mydspv1` may push.

## Do not

- Store favourite channels / news tags only in sessionStorage or a device-local key outside fullArchive.
- Skip `markWorkspaceChangedForSync` on channel/tag mutations.
- Return early from pull on portfolio conflicts without applying workspace extras.
- Document YouTube/News as “per device” (notification **OS permission** stays per device; **category toggles and favourites sync**).

## When adding new media prefs

Add export/import helpers, wire them into `captureFullWorkspace` + `applyWorkspaceExtrasFromPreview`, mark dirty on edit, cover with a tip-harness / sync test, and update `SYNC_SETUP.md` / `SYNC_SMOKE.md`.
